        "@value": "{\"action\":\"suspend the application to request an acceptable ID in the new name\",\"actor\":\"adjudicator\",\"alternative_quotes\":[],\"choice_text\":\"\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"more than one year prior to applying on form DS-11 AND has not updated her/his ID\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"object\":\"the application\",\"scope_text\":\"If the applicant has had a material name change more than one year prior to applying on form DS-11 but has not updated ID to reflect the material name change\",\"summary\":\"If the applicant had a material name change more than one year prior to applying on Form DS-11 without updating ID, the adjudicator must suspend the application to request acceptable ID in the new name.\"}",
