        "@value": "{\"action\":\"request additional evidence of U.S. citizenship/non-citizen U.S. nationality or identity\",\"actor\":\"adjudicator\",\"alternative_quotes\":[],\"choice_text\":\"\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"kind\":\"permission\",\"logic_text\":\"evidence of U.S. citizenship/non-citizen U.S. nationality or identity\",\"modality\":\"may\",\"object\":\"additional evidence of U.S. citizenship/non-citizen U.S. nationality or identity\",\"scope_text\":\"When a court order makes the applicant's former name confidential\",\"summary\":\"When an applicant's former name is made confidential in a court order, the adjudicator may request additional evidence of citizenship/non-citizen nationality or identity under 22 CFR 51.23 and 51.45.\"}",
