\",\"section_id\":\"fam-names-04\",\"start\":3766,\"summary\":\"When an applicant's former name is made confidential in a court order, the adjudicator may request additional evidence of citizenship/non-citizen nationality or identity under 22 CFR 51.23 and 51.45.\",\"target_ids\":[]}",
